sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Sender
    participant S as server.ts
    participant P as MessagePipeline
    participant R as Redis
    participant D as dispatcher
    participant B as Recipient

    A->>S: message {id, type:'text', text}
    S->>S: parseClientFrame — size, envelope, version, closed lists
    Note over S: a frame with no `version` is UNSUPPORTED_VERSION,<br/>not BAD_ENVELOPE (F-042, open)
    S->>P: send(sid, clientId, contentType, text)
    P->>R: rateLimit('message')  → 3/s burst 8
    P->>R: resolvePartner.lua  (route + dedupe, ONE script)
    Note over R: NOT_MATCHED | PARTNER_GONE | DEDUPE_FULL |<br/>DUPLICATE | OK{mid, partner, partnerInstance}
    P->>P: moderate({type, text})
    alt action == 'block'
        P->>P: persist anyway (evidence)
        P-->>A: error MESSAGE_WITHHELD (vague, on purpose)
    else deliverable
        P->>D: toSession(partner, message)
        D->>B: local frame, or PUBLISH → subscriber → frame
        Note over D: 'dropped' → status = 'undelivered'
    end
    P->>P: retention.enqueue(message + moderation_events)
    P-->>A: message_ack {clientMsgId, messageId, route, status}
